From 7c0b71513da1175f4e774af47f5f31e876ccdccc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andreas Baierl <ichgeh@imkreisrum.de>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 15:35:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 58/59] Make MSE and the ZDF special handling switchable

VDR sends both options with the render parameters, they apply to the
next page. Without the ZDF special handling the ZDF applications are not
forced to plain HTML5 videos and use their dash player.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
---
